<header><p class="enc-kicker">Institution</p><h1 class="enc-title">Kataphraktoi</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Kataphraktoi, or <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cataphract">cataphracts</a>, were heavily armoured cavalry in which both rider and often horse were protected by armour. They were a core element of Parthian and Sasanian armies. The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sasanian-empire">Sasanian Empire</a> relied on them as its elite striking force.</p></div>
